  "adaptations": [
    "Display mesh functions extracted without evaluator/history/cache imports; generator independently reads STEP in mm.",
    "Relative module URLs; instance-scoped interaction, cancellation, validation, worker timeout and disposal.",
    "Both models use one display origin and camera; no separate normalization or scoring.",
    "Offscreen VTK raster thumbnails share one orthographic camera; candidate left, reference right; no face dropping.",
    "Canvas CSS dimensions are independent of device-pixel drawing buffer; immediate initial resize and bounded grid sizing.",
    "Four exact orthographic directions; tessellated whole-model and optional GT-bound KOR/KIR material partitions, never scoring."
